  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "It’s true:  Here, all paths do lead to the sea.  At Sea Esta, your entire group will enjoy beautiful, designer-inspired accommodations plus privacy, and a relaxing place to retreat that is just down the path from the beach.  <br> The community of WaterSound West Beach is tucked between Eastern Lake and Deer Lake on the south side of Scenic Highway 30a.  With the Timpoochee Trail (better known as the 30A bike path) connecting over 17 miles of noteworthy communities, rare dune lakes, top restaurants, bars, and dozens of options for retail therapy, you’ll find yourself in the middle of tough decisions, like do I bike or walk to the beach? Should we hit the pool before lunch? Enjoy the Gulf on the YOLO board or kayak?<br> <br>The WaterSound West Beach community pool and pavilion are just minutes from your doorstep.   Follow the path to this very large pool and pavilion, which includes fountains and a zero-entry feature, perfect for any age group.  After a swim, continue to follow the paths right to the Gulf of Mexico.  Watersound West Beach beautifully preserves the large dunes and natural landscape, letting the mixed bike and pedestrian path wind through it all.<br> <br>Enter the home through a quaint front porch into its large, open floor plan where the coastal décor comes to life!  In the kitchen, the blue cabinetry perfectly blends with updated stainless-steel appliances.  The large island with breakfast seating will prepare a large meal or light appetizers, enjoyable for everyone.  This kitchen is made for function and is ready to serve up your favorite recipes.<br> <br>On the first floor resides the home’s primary suite, which boasts clean, crisp décor and a beautifully finished linen bed.  The bedroom’s bath is privately accessed within the bedroom, offering the utmost in privacy for your guest. The bathroom encompasses natural tones through its granite countertops and masonry details.  This bathroom is equipped with double vanities and a standing shower.  There is a first-floor powder bath just for your extra guests.<br><br> Moving to the home’s second floor, the younger guests in your group can enjoy the media room located at the top of the stairs.  A flat-screen TV, storage, and a sofa may offer an ideal place for a movie or family game night! Built-in bunk beds just off the media room offer two extra sleep spots and are vibrantly decorated like our Gulf Coast's sunsets.<br><br> The home’s third bedroom offers a queen bed, flat-screen TV, and an additional en suite bathroom.  Natural tones continue in this bathroom with its granite countertops and tile detail.<br> <br>The true primary bedroom shows the same calming coastal colors and adds an element of teal with its headboard. A Sea Esta will certainly be on your agenda while staying in this bedroom retreat.  The en suite bathroom has a very large standing shower, double vanity sinks, and a large mirror.<br> <br>After a long day on the beach, what better way to relax than to return to this outstanding outdoor living space <br> <br>*Strictly Enforced - No Pets & No Smoking*<br>**Russell Vacation Rentals is not liable for any construction that may occur outside of the properties we manage. **<br><br>Rental Agreement Requirement<br>After booking confirmation, you will receive a Rental Agreement via email, sent as an E-Sign document with required signature fields.<br>The Rental Agreement must be signed before your arrival instructions are released.<br><br>STR23-002254<br>Walton Tax 14445<br><br>Property Details:<br>3 Bedroom 3.4 Bath Home - Sleeps 8<br><br>Downstairs Primary Bedroom - 1 King, Large flat-screen TV &  walk-in closet <br>Upstairs Guest Bedroom - 1 Queen, Large flat-screen TV & two separate closets <br>Upstairs Primary Bedroom - 1 King, Large flat-screen TV & walk-in closet <br>Hall Bunk Bed - 2 Twin/ Single Bunk<br>Upstairs Bonus Room - Large flat-screen TV <br>Fully equipped kitchen - Standard & Keurig Coffee Makers<br>Washer/Dryer<br>DVD Player /Satellite / Cable/Wi-Fi<br>Propane Gas Grill<br>The community pool is within walking distance - approximately a quarter mile<br> Boardwalk leading to beach access over the lake.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
